{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2hXZFvB5aLWLE65fy4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fitted Dq and B to the three spin-allowed bands, then set C using the spin-forbidden ¹E band.\n\n**1. Dq and B from the spin-allowed bands.** For octahedral d⁸ with a ³A₂g ground state:\n- ν₁ is ³A₂ → ³T₂, and it equals 10Dq. That gives a first estimate of Dq = 740 cm⁻¹.\n- ν₂ and ν₃ (³A₂ → ³T₁(F) and ³T₁(P)) are given by ν = ½(15B + 30Dq) ∓ ½√[(15B − 10Dq)² + 120B·Dq].\n\nTaking each band separately gives answers that don't quite agree, so I did a least-squares fit of all three bands with the full d⁸ ligand-field matrices:\n- **Dq ≈ 748 cm⁻¹**\n- **B ≈ 934 cm⁻¹**\n\n| Band | Calculated (cm⁻¹) | Observed (cm⁻¹) |\n|---|---|---|\n| ³T₂ | 7 481 | 7 400 |\n| ³T₁(1) | 12 603 | 12 660 |\n| ³T₁(2) | 23 845 | 23 840 |\n\nThe root-mean-square error is about 57 cm⁻¹. These triplet bands do not depend on C.\n\n**2. C from the ¹E band.** The ¹E level comes from the ¹D term, so its energy depends mainly on C, rising by about 2 cm⁻¹ for each 1 cm⁻¹ increase in C:\n- With Dq = 748 and B = 934, C = 4 850 puts ¹E at 16 536 cm⁻¹.\n- C = 4 100 puts it at 15 036 cm⁻¹.\n\nInterpolating linearly between these two points to reach the observed 15 150 cm⁻¹ gives **C ≈ 4 160 cm⁻¹**, so C/B ≈ 4.45. I calculated the two endpoints but did not recompute the levels at C = 4 160 itself.\n\nB is about 85 % of the free Ni²⁺ ion value of roughly 1 080 cm⁻¹ (standard reference value, not computed here). That small reduction fits the fairly ionic Ni–F bonding expected in a fluoride complex.\n\n{\"Dq\": 748, \"B\": 934, \"C\": 4160, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Dq and B fitted to three spin-allowed triplet bands; C set from the spin-forbidden 1E band at 15150 cm-1.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1376,"cache_read_input_tokens":9526,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1376,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f910c408-b72e-4041-a7b7-2dcee81bb85d","uuid":"192651bd-ee1b-4c58-8b88-3cf5ab4c8f7d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:16:40.684Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2hX8xnYyBm5NcxzimQ"}
